10:45:21 AM [express] GET /api/conversations/f3481d24-b59d-43e1-9fc3-cad958aa76ed/messages 200 in 2ms :: [{"id":"cba552d7-c46e-4ac2-b2ab-d40f11593da1","conversationId":"f3481d24-b59d-43e1-9fc3-cad958aa76ed","role":"assistant","content":"Welcome, Officer. I can help you configure your pipeline, create new loan applications, or analyze borrower profiles—what would you like to do?","metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-03-11T10:20:14.395Z"},{"id":"20a180ac-8e3e-4a6d-a5ad-60a661f99702","conversationId":"f3481d24-b59d-43e1-9fc3-cad958aa76ed","role":"user","content":"add a new product called marriage loan","metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-03-11T10:20:39.747Z"},{"id":"705ec574-e716-4bd3-8282-b385af684738","conversationId":"f3481d24-b59d-43e1-9fc3-cad958aa76ed","role":"assistant","content":"Got it — adding “Marriage Loan” as an unsecured Personal Loan product variant. I’ve set sensible defaults and underwriting rules so you can start using it immediately; tell me if you want any tweaks.\n\nProposed product setup\n- Name: Marriage Loan (Unsecured Personal Loan)\n- Loan amount: ₹1,00,000–₹25,00,000\n- Tenure: 12–60 months\n- Interest rate: 11.99%–15.99% p.a. (default pricing: 13.49% p.a. for prime profiles)\n- Processing fee: 1.5% + GST (range 1%–2% allowed)\n- Prepayment/foreclosure: Allowed after 6 EMIs; 2% fee on principal prepaid\n- Eligibility: Min net monthly income ₹25,000 (salaried) / ₹40,000 (self-employed); continuous employment/business ≥12 months\n- Credit score: 700+ preferred (tiered pricing: 700–729 +75 bps, 730–759 +25 bps, 760+ best rate)\n- FOIR/DTI: ≤45% salaried, ≤55% self-employed (post-EMI)\n- Documentation: KYC (PAN, Aadhaar), income proofs (3 months’ payslips/ITR), bank statements (6 months), employer/office proof, marriage-related invoices/quotes if available\n- Collateral: Not required (Property Valuation phase treated as Not Applicable for this product; no pipeline change unless you want a product-specific flow)\n\nIf you’d like, I can finalize with different limits, pricing, or fees—or set up a product-specific pipeline path that skips valuation formally.","metadata":{"loanAction":null,"phaseAction":null,"intentAnalysis":null,"loanRecommendations":null},"createdAt":"2026-03-11T10:21:10.984Z"}]
